{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54386","headline":"台州早春 · 任翻","name":"台州早春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微雨夜来歇，江南春色回。\n已惊时不住，还恐老相催。\n人好千场醉，花无百日开。\n岂堪沧海畔，爲客十年来。\n（见《四库珍本初集》本《天台前集》卷下）（按：《全唐诗续补遗》卷十六据《舆地纪胜》收此诗末二句。\n《全唐诗》卷一四八收作刘长卿诗，题作《早春》，但诗中海畔爲客十年之意，与刘生平不合。\n任翻在台州生活时间较长，应爲其所作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"任翻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54386.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54386","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}